      <div class="hero-lead">
        <p class="lead"><strong>GTAMP</strong> is a multiplayer modification for Grand Theft Auto&nbsp;V, built on our own code. <strong>Play</strong> on community-run servers, or <strong>create</strong> your own world.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <div class="players">
          <span class="live-dot"></span>Join the <span class="current-players"><%= livePlayers.toLocaleString('en-US') %></span> people playing right now!
        </div>
        <a id="dl" href="/download/NSM.exe">
          <span class="txt">DOWNLOAD GTAMP</span>
          <span class="desc">NSM.exe</span>
        </a>
        <p class="plaText">By downloading, you agree to the terms of the <a href="/terms">GTAMP License Agreement</a></p>
        <div class="server">
          <a class="btn block" href="/run-server">Create your own server</a>
