<!-- FEATURES -->
<section class="features">
  <div class="container"><div class="spacer">
    <div class="fx"><div class="c-xs-12">
      <div class="preamb">
        <p>Building on everything we learned shipping our own launcher, relay server, and in-game hook, GTAMP is a <em>community-driven</em> multiplayer project that puts players and server owners <em>first</em>.<br>No compromises, no lock-in — just play.</p>
      </div>
    </div></div>
    <h1>What we have for you</h1>
    <div class="fx">
      <div class="c-lg-3 c-md-4 c-sm-6 c-xs-12">
        <article class="a1">
          <h2><div class="icon-wrap"><span class="material-icons-outlined md-24">cloud_download</span></div>Download &amp; play</h2>
          <span class="txt">GTAMP lets servers ship custom cars, maps, weapons, and more — delivered <em>dynamically</em> as you play.</span>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="c-lg-3 c-md-4 c-sm-6 c-xs-12">
        <article class="a2">
          <h2><div class="icon-wrap"><span class="material-icons-outlined md-24">supervisor_account</span></div>Nametags &amp; blips</h2>
          <span class="txt">FiveM-style nametags and map blips show you who's who. You'll <em>never</em> lose your crew.</span>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="c-lg-3 c-md-4 c-sm-6 c-xs-12">
        <article class="a3">
          <h2><div class="icon-wrap"><span class="material-icons-outlined md-24">sync_alt</span></div>Sync quality</h2>
          <span class="txt">GTAMP's own UDP relay keeps every player smoothly in sync, so you get the <em>best</em> experience around.</span>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="c-lg-3 c-md-4 c-sm-6 c-xs-12">
        <article class="a4">
          <h2><div class="icon-wrap"><span class="material-icons-outlined md-24">widgets</span></div>Standalone</h2>
          <span class="txt">GTAMP doesn't modify your GTAV installation, so you can switch between GTA Online and GTAMP <em>freely</em>.</span>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h2 class="closing">Resulting in endless possibilities to play or create your desired gamemode!</h2>
  </div></div>
</section>

